.TH ESL-BATCH 1 "March 2026" "ecoSignalLab 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
esl-batch \- batch analysis for directories of audio files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B esl batch
.I input_dir
.B \-\-out
.I out_dir
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run analysis across a folder of supported audio files and emit per-file outputs
plus batch index summaries.
.SH COMMON OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-metrics\fR \fILIST\fR
Comma-separated analysis metric set.
.TP
\fB\-\-report-metrics\fR \fILIST\fR
Metric means to expose as columns in batch index CSV.
.TP
\fB\-\-csv\fR
Write per-file CSV outputs.
.TP
\fB\-\-parquet\fR
Write per-file Parquet outputs.
.TP
\fB\-\-hdf5\fR
Write per-file HDF5 outputs.
.TP
\fB\-\-mat\fR
Write per-file MATLAB outputs.
.TP
\fB\-\-plot\fR
Generate plots per file.
.TP
\fB\-\-calibration\fR \fIPATH\fR
Calibration YAML/JSON path.
.TP
\fB\-\-verbosity\fR \fI0..3\fR
Verbosity level.
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR \fI0..2\fR
Debug level.
.SH EXAMPLE
.B esl batch input_dir --out out_batch --metrics rms_dbfs,snr_db,spl_a_db --report-metrics snr_db,spl_a_db --csv --parquet
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR esl (1)
